SUMMARY:Heal from the Inner Critics\, where Negativity Starts and Ends 
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nYou know what it
 ’s like to have a negative thought that knocks you down when you’re tr
 ying to pick yourself up. Maybe a scene of future failure that makes you f
 eel suddenly threatened\, or the voice of someone from the past who really
  did say awful things about you. If you’re like most people\, you start 
 unconsciously reacting in ways so familiar you think this is who you are a
 nd the crisis is happening now. Some people become fighters\, who fight ba
 ck so automatically against negative thoughts that they’re soon picking 
 fights with anyone they can blame for an offensive pattern. Other people b
 ecome defeated victims\, whose bodies go into exhaustion and pain so quick
 ly from negative thinking that they feel hopeless and decide well\, I gues
 s I just can’t do my life.\n\nBut the good news is that you can do your 
 life\, and it doesn’t have to take years of training like meditation to 
 rise above your own reactions. In fact\, traditional practices are often p
 art of the problem\, as they further criticize you for being too attached\
 , too sensitive\, too needy\, or something else that is normal for you. Jo
 in us this Sunday May 31\, 2026 for a refreshing free look at where inner 
 critics come from and how to handle them with your own unbeatable combinat
 ion of human emotions and spiritual consciousness. Forget old painful hars
 h rule systems. You are the self-creating creator who is more powerful tha
 n you were ever taught. You are always more ready than you know to set you
 rself free.\n\nWhat you believe about yourself is the key. What you believ
 e isn’t possible for you is what you won’t even be able to try. Repeat
 ing critical thoughts will stop you from trying the impossible. “Oh that
 ’s a bad idea\, only stupid bad people would consider doing that.” But
  it may be something you really need for your life\, so you need to do it 
 your way. Your mind becomes your enemy only when it’s taken over by fals
 e beliefs. “I wish I could do what other people can do but I can’t. He
 aling\, manifesting\, creativity\, happiness\, love\, prosperity. Nope\, I
 ’m a failure. I guess there’s something wrong with me.” Of course\, 
 as soon as you agree with such thinking\, more false beliefs and critical 
 thoughts follow rapidly. Soon\, you are what you believe and that’s all 
 you can do.\n\nRunaway negative thinking is based on false negative self-b
 eliefs\, which are ideas that simply aren’t healthy or true for you. But
  you’re holding on trying to make it work. To stop negative thinking man
 y people think they need to do something they’ve haven’t done before. 
 “Tell me a new technique or person who will fix this for me!” When man
 ipulations fail\, they feel worse and try harder. “I promise to do it ri
 ght\, I just need to stop feeling hurt\, angry\, scared\, lonely or whatev
 er!”\n\nBut doing something new isn’t the answer. You need to be somet
 hing new. What you need to be is your true self\, who may feel very differ
 ent from what other people or society are validating. What devastates and 
 cripples your life is believing and following other people’s wrong rules
  for you. Nobody else knows what’s best for you as much as you can! Lear
 n to follow your own inner guidance\, both emotional and spiritual. Then y
 ou won’t believe the false beliefs that make people suffer. You will suc
 ceed naturally when you know who you really are and what’s true for you.
  You will fall in love with yourself and let the Universe give you the mos
 t wonderful perfect life that you always wanted and needed. You will find 
 your own ways to practice clear thinking\, vibrant feeling\, inner safety 
 and outer prosperity.\n\nFor this meetup\, consider what kinds of negative
  thought patterns you tend to get stuck in. What happens when your moods a
 nd physical symptoms become overwhelming? Be gentle and compassionate with
  yourself as you consider maybe all of your pain and struggle come from no
 t understanding how life works for you. The wrong rules make you suffer\, 
 so maybe the right rules\, set by yourself\, would set you free. After som
 e check-ins to share and relate\, I’ll explain how we as spiritual being
 s must choose the beliefs that we want to experience. False negative belie
 fs drive the thoughts and situations that ruin life. You can release your 
 past trauma and get a new future when you work with your higher self and s
 oul to know what’s best for you. We’ll conclude with a guided meditati
 on to observe and release the negative ego which drives inner critics\, so
  we no longer belong in a world of negative people and unhealthy futures. 
 You deserve to let yourself thrive in the best life that you always wanted
 .\n\nWelcome! Our Inner Selves Mastery spiritual support group is free onl
 ine every Sunday 11am-130pm EDT\, with the last 30 minutes for a guided me
 ditation. If you can’t stay you can get the recording. You can signup he
 re for this meeting and visit www.signupISM.com for all events\, newslette
 r\, videos\, and more.\n\nBest wishes\,\nCarl Johann Schroeder\nInner Selv
 es Mastery\nspiritual teaching and coaching\nquick-links at [www.signupISM
 .com](http://www.signupISM.com)
