SUMMARY:Salsa Night! Celebrating June BDAYS @ Komana in Cary
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n🌺🌴 JUNE BIRT
 HDAYS TROPICAL AFFAIR 🌴🌺\nSalsa4Life Wednesdays at KōMANA 🔥\nCel
 ebrating Michael Douglas + Simone + ALL June Babies! 🎉\nThrow on your t
 ropical whites\, island vibes\, and get ready to dance the night away.\n
 ✨ Doors Open 7:15 PM – Meet & Greet Mixer\n🍹 Dance • Drink • Co
 nnect\n💃 Salsa & Bachata Lesson | 7:30–8:30 PM\nBeginner-friendly •
  No partner needed\n🎁 Birthday Dance + Door Prizes\n🕺 Social Dancing
  | 8:30–11:30 PM\n🎧 DJ Giovanni spinning Salsa • Merengue • Bacha
 ta • Latin Hits 🔥\n🌺 Hawaiian Tropical Vibes All Night\n❄️ Air
 -conditioned\n🪩 Spacious dance floor\n🚗 Free parking\n🔥 Drink spe
 cials all night\n💲$10 Before 9 PM\n💲$15 After 9 PM\n📍 KōMANA Bre
 wing Co. – 1020 Ryan Rd. Cary\, NC (Village Square Shopping Center)\n
 🔞 18+ to party | 21+ to drink\n🌴 JUNE BABIES — THIS IS YOUR NIGHT 
 🌴\nCome celebrate\, dance\, and bring the island energy with us! 💃
